              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కోరిక — kōrika — \"a wish\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కోరిక (kōrika) is native Dravidian, one word with Tamil kōrikkai, \"request, wish\", and Kannada kōṟike, \"wishing\" (DEDR 2232), which lists kōrika itself."
            }
          ]
        },
